    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"XmlServletWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet.context\"><code>XmlServletWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>, loading bean\ndefinitions from the given resources and automatically refreshing the context.",
