    {
      "source": "<code>relativeClass</code> - class whose package will be used as a prefix when loading each\nspecified resource name",
      "translation": "<code>relativeClass</code> - 其包将用作加载每个指定资源名称时的前缀的类",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resourceNames</code> - relatively-qualified names of resources to load",
      "translation": "<code>resourceNames</code> - 要加载的资源的相对限定名称",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates the given environment to underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/xml/XmlBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>XmlBeanDefinitionReader</code></a>.\nShould be called before any call to <a href=\"#load(org.springframework.core.io.Resource...)\"><code>load(Resource...)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的环境委托给底层的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/xml/XmlBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>XmlBeanDefinitionReader</code></a>。应在调用任何<a href=\"#load(org.springframework.core.io.Resource...)\"><code>load(Resource...)</code></a>之前执行。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: In case of multiple config locations, later bean definitions will override ones\ndefined in earlier loaded files. This can be leveraged to deliberately override certain\nbean definitions through an extra XML file.",
      "translation": "注意：在存在多个配置位置的情况下，后加载的 Bean 定义将覆盖先前文件中定义的 Bean。可以利用这一点，通过额外的 XML 文件故意覆盖某些 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
